.To whom it may concern...

Since we've started a thread on the budget, it "might behoove us"
to have a clearer picture of who the players are. To that end -- this
three-parter is extracted from a board accessible via a gateway in the
"FedWorld BBS" (one dealing with Federal Register Electronic News).
Note that (where possible) I've grouped the appointees by agency.

This should be about 98% accurate -- I'm not an expert on the structure
of the Fed -- but it will give us something to work from. Enjoy! /JG

